{"id":"allzu","lemma":"allzu","pos":"adv","rank":2453,"glosses":["all too"],"ipa":"/ˈalt͡suː/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/60/De-allzu.ogg/De-allzu.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ich bin nicht allzu glücklich.","en":"I'm not too happy.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"happy"}]},{"text":"Das ist nur allzu wahr.","en":"It is only too true.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"only"},null,{"g":"true, real"}]},{"text":"Ich weiß darüber nicht allzu viel.","en":"I don't know too much about it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"above"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"much, a lot"}]},{"text":"Allzu schwer sollte das nicht sein.","en":"That shouldn't be too difficult.","words":[null,{"g":"heavy, weighty"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be"}]},{"text":"Du bist nicht allzu hungrig, oder?","en":"You're not very hungry, are you?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"hungry"},{"g":"or"}]}]}